  "mainHtml": "<main class=\"bg-white\"><div class=\"bg-off-white\"><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-1 mb-8 pt-8 lg:mb-16 breadcrumb\"><a href=\"/de/questions\">Häufige Frage</a><i class=\"icon\">chevron_right</i><a href=\"/de/question_categories/account\">Konto</a></div><div class=\"lg:flex gap-16 mb-16\"><div class=\"lg:w-3/4\"><h1 class=\"font-serif text-5xl mb-8\">Konto</h1><ul class=\"bg-white rounded-lg xl:grid grid-cols-2 gap-16 p-8 test-questions\"><li class=\"mb-12 xl:mb-0\"><h2 class=\"text-xl text-semibold mb-4\"><a href=\"/de/questions/i-am-experiencing-technical-problems-with-the-site-how-can-i-contact-support_48e0b740-0bb5-4694-9c16-81683238c13f\" class=\"text-green-600 hover:text-green-700 transition-colors\">I am experiencing technical problems with the site, how can I contact support?</a></h2><p class=\"mb-4\">The fastest and easiest way to get in touch with us is to email support@biddershighway.com. We will get back to you as soon as we can.</p><a href=\"/de/questions/i-am-experiencing-technical-problems-with-the-site-how-can-i-contact-support_48e0b740-0bb5-4694-9c16-81683238c13f\" class=\"underline hover:text-neutral-800\">Mehr erfahren</a></li><li class=\"mb-12 xl:mb-0\"><h2 class=\"text-xl text-semibold mb-4\"><a href=\"/de/questions/is-swedish-bankid-required-to-log-in_28a737f5-8a00-4b25-bac2-2ae3b3a8e0cc\" class=\"text-green-600 hover:text-green-700 transition-colors\">Is Swedish BankID required to log in?</a></h2><p class=\"mb-4\">We'd prefer you use it if you have it, but it is not necessary. Bidders Highway wants to be the safest and most convenient marketplace for enthusiast cars and BankID is, in addition to being very easy to use as a login, also an excellent way for buyers and sellers to prove their identity. But not everyone has BankID, and we also have foreign users. There is the option to register an account and...</p><a href=\"/de/questions/is-swedish-bankid-required-to-log-in_28a737f5-8a00-4b25-bac2-2ae3b3a8e0cc\" class=\"underline hover:text-neutral-800\">Mehr erfahren</a></li><li class=\"mb-12 xl:mb-0\"><h2 class=\"text-xl text-semibold mb-4\"><a href=\"/de/questions/what-happens-if-someone-posts-negative-comments-about-my-car_4866224a-dedc-42a5-ac30-01aac43c9189\" class=\"text-green-600 hover:text-green-700 transition-colors\">What happens if someone posts negative comments about my car?</a></h2><p class=\"mb-4\">All comments are reviewed by our moderators, who ensures that the comments section is kept in good order. We will not approve derogatory or negative comments about the auctions that are irrelevant or unfounded. If you believe that a posted comment violates our commenting guidelines, please contact support@biddershighway.com and we will review the matter as soon as possible.</p><a href=\"/de/questions/what-happens-if-someone-posts-negative-comments-about-my-car_4866224a-dedc-42a5-ac30-01aac43c9189\" class=\"underline hover:text-neutral-800\">Mehr erfahren</a></li><li class=\"mb-12 xl:mb-0\"><h2 class=\"text-xl text-semibold mb-4\"><a href=\"/de/questions/do-you-sell-all-types-of-vehicles_ce6ea8d5-33d7-4846-abe4-a35eeec581da\" class=\"text-green-600 hover:text-green-700 transition-colors\">Do you sell all types of vehicles?</a></h2><p class=\"mb-4\">Bidders Highway focuses solely on enthusiast and collector vehicles, and that is of course a broad term. The best thing to do is to contact us so we can have a dialogue to see if your vehicle fits our target group.</p><a href=\"/de/questions/do-you-sell-all-types-of-vehicles_ce6ea8d5-33d7-4846-abe4-a35eeec581da\" class=\"underline hover:text-neutral-800\">Mehr erfahren</a></li><li class=\"mb-12 xl:mb-0\"><h2 class=\"text-xl text-semibold mb-4\"><a href=\"/de/questions/i-cant-log-in-what-should-i-do_0199e8d5-a261-75aa-b1be-27d38b948bf9\" class=\"text-green-600 hover:text-green-700 transition-colors\">I can’t log in — what should I do?</a></h2><p class=\"mb-4\">Check your sign‑in method. You must use the same method you used when you created your account. </p><a href=\"/de/questions/i-cant-log-in-what-should-i-do_0199e8d5-a261-75aa-b1be-27d38b948bf9\" class=\"underline hover:text-neutral-800\">Mehr erfahren</a></li><li class=\"mb-12 xl:mb-0\"><h2 class=\"text-xl text-semibold mb-4\"><a href=\"/de/questions/can-i-change-my-sign-in-method_0199e8d8-1da0-795e-bf98-a1ab441fa8e1\" class=\"text-green-600 hover:text-green-700 transition-colors\">Can I change my sign‑in method?</a></h2><p class=\"mb-4\">Your account is tied to the method you chose at sign‑up (BankID or email/password). Changing the sign‑in method for an existing account isn’t supported at this time. Send us an email and we'll help you out support@biddershighway.com</p><a href=\"/de/questions/can-i-change-my-sign-in-method_0199e8d8-1da0-795e-bf98-a1ab441fa8e1\" class=\"underline hover:text-neutral-800\">Mehr erfahren</a></li></ul></div><div class=\"lg:w-1/4 mt-8 mb-8 lg:mt-0\"><h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold mb-6\">Kategorien</h2><ul class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2 lg:block\"><li><a href=\"/de/questions\" class=\"block lg:px-4 lg:py-3 font-semibold text-neutral-500 hover:text-neutral-600 transition-colors border rounded border-transparent\">Alle</a></li><li><a href=\"/de/question_categories/buying\" class=\"block lg:px-4 lg:py-3 font-semibold text-neutral-500 hover:text-neutral-600 transition-colors border rounded border-transparent\">Einkaufen</a></li><li><a href=\"/de/question_categories/selling\" class=\"block lg:px-4 lg:py-3 font-semibold text-neutral-500 hover:text-neutral-600 transition-colors border rounded border-transparent\">Verkaufen</a></li><li><a href=\"/de/question_categories/bidding\" class=\"block lg:px-4 lg:py-3 font-semibold text-neutral-500 hover:text-neutral-600 transition-colors border rounded border-transparent\">Bieten</a></li><li><a href=\"/de/question_categories/documentation\" class=\"block lg:px-4 lg:py-3 font-semibold text-neutral-500 hover:text-neutral-600 transition-colors border rounded border-transparent\">Dokumentation</a></li><li><a href=\"/de/question_categories/account\" class=\"block lg:px-4 lg:py-3 font-semibold text-neutral-500 hover:text-neutral-600 transition-colors border rounded border-transparent px-2 border-black! text-black! hover:text-black!\">Konto</a></li><li><a href=\"/de/question_categories/payment\" class=\"block lg:px-4 lg:py-3 font-semibold text-neutral-500 hover:text-neutral-600 transition-colors border rounded border-transparent\">Zahlungen</a></li><li><a href=\"/de/question_categories/shipping\" class=\"block lg:px-4 lg:py-3 font-semibold text-neutral-500 hover:text-neutral-600 transition-colors border rounded border-transparent\">Transport</a></li><li><a href=\"/de/question_categories/verification\" class=\"block lg:px-4 lg:py-3 font-semibold text-neutral-500 hover:text-neutral-600 transition-colors border rounded border-transparent\">Verifizierung</a></li></ul></div></div></div><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 pb-16\"><div class=\"w-full p-8 bg-amber-100 rounded sm:flex justify-between items-center\"><div><h2 class=\"font-serif text-2xl sm:text-4xl mb-4\">Weitere Fragen?</h2><p class=\"text-sm sm:text-base mb-2 sm:mb-8\">Sie können uns eine E-Mail senden. Wir helfen Ihnen gerne weiter!</p><a href=\"mailto:support@biddershighway.com\" class=\"font-bold underline hover:text-neutral-800\">support@biddershighway.com</a></div><a href=\"mailto:support@biddershighway.com\" class=\"hidden sm:block\"><img src=\"/assets/contact-us-4411369c.svg\" alt=\"Contact us\" class=\"w-48 h-36\"></a></div></div><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 text-center py-8\"><a href=\"/de\" class=\"inline-block rounded-sm cursor-pointer transition-colors px-4 py-2 text-white bg-jaffa hover:bg-zest disabled:bg-yellow-700 disabled:text-neutral-300 px-6 py-3\">Alle unsere Autoauktionen ansehen</a></div></div></main>",
